 },
 "html": "<h2 id=\"secao-2-3\">2.3 Consultas SQL <span class=\"selo selo--complemento\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\" title=\"Técnica que não estava no material de estudo original\">Complemento</span></h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> extrai, filtra, combina e agrega dados direto no banco com SQL e traz o resultado como DataFrame (<code>pd.read_sql_query</code>).</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> sempre que os dados estiverem em um banco de dados. Filtrar e agregar no banco é mais rápido e traz para o Python só o necessário.</p>\n<p>Aqui, as tabelas do exemplo são carregadas em um banco <strong>SQLite em memória</strong> (biblioteca padrão do Python), o que permite executar as consultas sem servidor. Em um projeto real, troque apenas a conexão:</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">conn = sqlite3.<span class=\"tk-fn\">connect</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">nome_do_banco.db</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)                               <span class=\"tk-com\"># arquivo SQLite</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">from</span> sqlalchemy <span class=\"tk-kw\">import</span> create_engine                                     <span class=\"tk-com\"># PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQL Server...</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">conn = <span class=\"tk-fn\">create_engine</span>(os.environ[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">URL_DO_BANCO</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>])                         <span class=\"tk-com\"># credenciais fora do código</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">df = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">read_sql_query</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">SELECT ... FROM nome_da_tabela</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, conn)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">import</span> sqlite3</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">conn = sqlite3.<span class=\"tk-fn\">connect</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">:memory:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_sql</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">tabela_principal</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, conn, index=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">tabela_categorias.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_sql</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">tabela_categorias</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, conn, index=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">eventos.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_sql</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">tabela_eventos</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, conn, index=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">consulta</span>(sql, params=<span class=\"tk-kw\">None</span>):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">    <span class=\"tk-com\"># Executa uma consulta SQL e devolve o resultado como DataFrame.</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">return</span> pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">read_sql_query</span>(sql, conn, params=params)</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"selecionar-filtrar-e-ordenar\">Selecionar, filtrar e ordenar</h3>\n<p><code>SELECT</code> escolhe as colunas, <code>WHERE</code> filtra as linhas, <code>ORDER BY</code> ordena e <code>LIMIT</code> limita o resultado. Valores vindos de variáveis entram como <strong>parâmetros</strong> (<code>:limite</code>), nunca concatenados no texto da consulta.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">consulta</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'''</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    SELECT coluna_id, coluna_cat, coluna_num_2</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    FROM tabela_principal</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    WHERE coluna_num_2 &gt; :limite</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"><span class=\"tk-str\">      AND coluna_cat IN (</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">A</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">, </span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">B</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    ORDER BY coluna_num_2 DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    LIMIT 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"><span class=\"tk-str\">'''</span>, params={<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">limite</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">100</span>})</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_id</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_cat</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_num_2</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">0</th>\n<td class=\"num\">185</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td class=\"num\">771.42</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">1</th>\n<td class=\"num\">616</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td class=\"num\">609.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">2</th>\n<td class=\"num\">702</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td class=\"num\">509.40</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">3</th>\n<td class=\"num\">5</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td class=\"num\">438.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">4</th>\n<td class=\"num\">128</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td class=\"num\">428.52</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">5</th>\n<td class=\"num\">302</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td class=\"num\">395.40</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">6</th>\n<td class=\"num\">87</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td class=\"num\">257.26</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">7</th>\n<td class=\"num\">650</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td class=\"num\">219.89</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">8</th>\n<td class=\"num\">372</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td class=\"num\">216.14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">9</th>\n<td class=\"num\">490</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td class=\"num\">215.74</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<h3 id=\"agregar-group-by-e-having\">Agregar: <code>GROUP BY</code> e <code>HAVING</code></h3>\n<p><code>GROUP BY</code> agrupa as linhas e as funções de agregação (<code>COUNT</code>, <code>SUM</code>, <code>AVG</code>, <code>MIN</code>, <code>MAX</code>) resumem cada grupo. <code>WHERE</code> filtra <strong>antes</strong> de agrupar, e <code>HAVING</code> filtra <strong>depois</strong>, usando o resultado da agregação.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">consulta</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'''</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    SELECT coluna_cat,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           COUNT(*)                            AS n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           COUNT(coluna_num)                   AS n_preenchidos,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           ROUND(AVG(coluna_num_2), 2)         AS media,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           SUM(coluna_binaria)                 AS n_binaria,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           ROUND(AVG(coluna_binaria) * 100, 1) AS pct_binaria</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    FROM tabela_principal</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    WHERE coluna_cat IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    GROUP BY coluna_cat</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    HAVING COUNT(*) &gt;= 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    ORDER BY n DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\"><span class=\"tk-str\">'''</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_cat</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">n_preenchidos</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">media</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">n_binaria</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">pct_binaria</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">0</th>\n<td>A</td>\n<td class=\"num\">494</td>\n<td class=\"num\">473</td>\n<td class=\"num\">86.07</td>\n<td class=\"num\">82</td>\n<td class=\"num\">16.60</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">1</th>\n<td>B</td>\n<td class=\"num\">292</td>\n<td class=\"num\">277</td>\n<td class=\"num\">100.11</td>\n<td class=\"num\">66</td>\n<td class=\"num\">22.60</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">2</th>\n<td>C</td>\n<td class=\"num\">189</td>\n<td class=\"num\">178</td>\n<td class=\"num\">107.92</td>\n<td class=\"num\">42</td>\n<td class=\"num\">22.20</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<h3 id=\"combinar-tabelas-join\">Combinar tabelas: <code>JOIN</code></h3>\n<p><code>LEFT JOIN</code> mantém todas as linhas da tabela da esquerda e traz da direita só o que tiver correspondência na chave; o que não tiver vira <code>NULL</code>. <code>INNER JOIN</code> mantém apenas as linhas com correspondência nas duas tabelas.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">consulta</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'''</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    SELECT p.coluna_cat,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           c.coluna_grupo,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           c.coluna_meta,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           COUNT(*) AS n</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    FROM tabela_principal AS p</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    LEFT JOIN tabela_categorias AS c</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           ON p.coluna_cat = c.coluna_cat</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    GROUP BY p.coluna_cat, c.coluna_grupo, c.coluna_meta</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    ORDER BY n DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\"><span class=\"tk-str\">'''</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_cat</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_grupo</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_meta</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">n</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">0</th>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>grupo_1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,200,000.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">494</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">1</th>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>grupo_1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">700,000.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">292</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">2</th>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>grupo_2</td>\n<td class=\"num\">450,000.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">189</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">3</th>\n<td class=\"num\">NaN</td>\n<td class=\"num\">NaN</td>\n<td class=\"num\">NaN</td>\n<td class=\"num\">30</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<h3 id=\"agregacao-condicional-cte-e-funcoes-de-janela\">Agregação condicional, CTE e funções de janela</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>CASE WHEN</code> cria regras dentro da consulta, por exemplo para contar só os registros que atendem a uma condição.</li>\n<li><code>WITH</code> (CTE) nomeia uma consulta intermediária e deixa consultas longas legíveis.</li>\n<li>Funções de janela (<code>OVER</code>) calculam sobre um conjunto de linhas <strong>sem agrupá-las</strong>: acumulados (<code>SUM ... OVER</code>), valor do período anterior (<code>LAG</code>) e rankings (<code>RANK</code>, <code>ROW_NUMBER</code>).</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">consulta</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'''</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    SELECT coluna_variante,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           COUNT(DISTINCT coluna_id_cliente) AS clientes,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN coluna_etapa = </span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">etapa_3</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> THEN coluna_id_cliente END) AS compradores,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           ROUND(1.0 * COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN coluna_etapa = </span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">etapa_3</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> THEN coluna_id_cliente END)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"><span class=\"tk-str\">                 / COUNT(DISTINCT coluna_id_cliente), 4) AS taxa_conversao</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    FROM tabela_eventos</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    GROUP BY coluna_variante</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\"><span class=\"tk-str\">'''</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_variante</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">clientes</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">compradores</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">taxa_conversao</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">0</th>\n<td>controle</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1486</td>\n<td class=\"num\">498</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.34</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">1</th>\n<td>tratamento</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1514</td>\n<td class=\"num\">511</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.34</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">consulta</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'''</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    WITH receita_mensal AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"><span class=\"tk-str\">        SELECT strftime(</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Y-</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%</span><span class=\"tk-str\">m</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">, coluna_data_evento) AS ano_mes,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"><span class=\"tk-str\">               SUM(coluna_valor_pedido)              AS receita,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"><span class=\"tk-str\">               COUNT(DISTINCT coluna_id_cliente)     AS compradores</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"><span class=\"tk-str\">        FROM tabela_eventos</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\"><span class=\"tk-str\">        WHERE coluna_etapa = </span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">etapa_3</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"><span class=\"tk-str\">        GROUP BY ano_mes</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    SELECT ano_mes,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           ROUND(receita, 2) AS receita,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           compradores,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           ROUND(SUM(receita) OVER (PARTITION BY substr(ano_mes, 1, 4) ORDER BY ano_mes), 2) AS acumulado_ano,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           ROUND(receita / LAG(receita) OVER (ORDER BY ano_mes) - 1, 4)                     AS var_mes_anterior,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           RANK() OVER (ORDER BY receita DESC)                                              AS ranking_receita</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    FROM receita_mensal</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    ORDER BY ano_mes</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"18\"><span class=\"tk-str\">'''</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">head</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">14</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">ano_mes</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">receita</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">compradores</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">acumulado_ano</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">var_mes_anterior</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">ranking_receita</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">0</th>\n<td>2023-01</td>\n<td class=\"num\">5,474.93</td>\n<td class=\"num\">32</td>\n<td class=\"num\">5,474.93</td>\n<td class=\"num\">NaN</td>\n<td class=\"num\">24</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">1</th>\n<td>2023-02</td>\n<td class=\"num\">9,775.14</td>\n<td class=\"num\">55</td>\n<td class=\"num\">15,250.07</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.79</td>\n<td class=\"num\">23</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">2</th>\n<td>2023-03</td>\n<td class=\"num\">15,359.49</td>\n<td class=\"num\">88</td>\n<td class=\"num\">30,609.56</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.57</td>\n<td class=\"num\">21</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">3</th>\n<td>2023-04</td>\n<td class=\"num\">15,565.83</td>\n<td class=\"num\">91</td>\n<td class=\"num\">46,175.39</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.01</td>\n<td class=\"num\">20</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">4</th>\n<td>2023-05</td>\n<td class=\"num\">22,657.67</td>\n<td class=\"num\">121</td>\n<td class=\"num\">68,833.06</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.46</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">5</th>\n<td>2023-06</td>\n<td class=\"num\">19,341.78</td>\n<td class=\"num\">118</td>\n<td class=\"num\">88,174.84</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.15</td>\n<td class=\"num\">15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">6</th>\n<td>2023-07</td>\n<td class=\"num\">20,696.34</td>\n<td class=\"num\">126</td>\n<td class=\"num\">108,871.18</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.07</td>\n<td class=\"num\">12</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">7</th>\n<td>2023-08</td>\n<td class=\"num\">20,163.04</td>\n<td class=\"num\">115</td>\n<td class=\"num\">129,034.22</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.03</td>\n<td class=\"num\">13</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">8</th>\n<td>2023-09</td>\n<td class=\"num\">21,908.37</td>\n<td class=\"num\">127</td>\n<td class=\"num\">150,942.59</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.09</td>\n<td class=\"num\">8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">9</th>\n<td>2023-10</td>\n<td class=\"num\">21,287.39</td>\n<td class=\"num\">124</td>\n<td class=\"num\">172,229.98</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.03</td>\n<td class=\"num\">9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">10</th>\n<td>2023-11</td>\n<td class=\"num\">23,899.37</td>\n<td class=\"num\">124</td>\n<td class=\"num\">196,129.35</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.12</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">11</th>\n<td>2023-12</td>\n<td class=\"num\">22,227.82</td>\n<td class=\"num\">131</td>\n<td class=\"num\">218,357.17</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.07</td>\n<td class=\"num\">6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">12</th>\n<td>2024-01</td>\n<td class=\"num\">21,217.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">131</td>\n<td class=\"num\">21,217.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.05</td>\n<td class=\"num\">11</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">13</th>\n<td>2024-02</td>\n<td class=\"num\">16,509.31</td>\n<td class=\"num\">106</td>\n<td class=\"num\">37,726.31</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.22</td>\n<td class=\"num\">19</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">conn.<span class=\"tk-fn\">close</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>Equivalências SQL ↔ pandas</strong></p>\n<div aria-label=\"Equivalências SQL ↔ pandas\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SQL</th>\n<th>pandas</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SELECT col_1, col_2</code></td>\n<td><code>df[['col_1', 'col_2']]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WHERE cond</code></td>\n<td><code>df.loc[cond]</code> / <code>df.query('...')</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ORDER BY col DESC LIMIT 10</code></td>\n<td><code>df.sort_values('col', ascending=False).head(10)</code> ou <code>df.nlargest(10, 'col')</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GROUP BY col</code> + <code>COUNT</code>/<code>SUM</code>/<code>AVG</code></td>\n<td><code>df.groupby('col').agg(...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>HAVING COUNT(*) &gt;= 30</code></td>\n<td><code>.agg(...).query('n &gt;= 30')</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>COUNT(DISTINCT col)</code></td>\n<td><code>.nunique()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LEFT JOIN ... ON</code></td>\n<td><code>df.merge(outra, on='chave', how='left')</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CASE WHEN ... THEN ... END</code></td>\n<td><code>np.where(...)</code> / <code>np.select(...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SUM(...) OVER (ORDER BY ...)</code></td>\n<td><code>.cumsum()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LAG(...) OVER (ORDER BY ...)</code></td>\n<td><code>.shift()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>RANK() OVER (ORDER BY ...)</code></td>\n<td><code>.rank(method='min', ascending=False)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UNION ALL</code></td>\n<td><code>pd.concat([df_1, df_2])</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>O que observar</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><ul>\n<li>Ordem lógica de execução: <code>FROM</code> → <code>JOIN</code> → <code>WHERE</code> → <code>GROUP BY</code> → <code>HAVING</code> → <code>SELECT</code> → <code>ORDER BY</code> → <code>LIMIT</code>. Por isso, um apelido criado no <code>SELECT</code> não pode ser usado no <code>WHERE</code>.</li>\n<li><code>NULL</code> não é igual a nada, nem a outro <code>NULL</code>: use <code>IS NULL</code> / <code>IS NOT NULL</code>. <code>COUNT(coluna)</code> ignora <code>NULL</code>, enquanto <code>COUNT(*)</code> conta todas as linhas.</li>\n<li>Divisão entre inteiros pode truncar o resultado em alguns bancos (<code>1 / 2 = 0</code>). Multiplique por <code>1.0</code> antes de dividir.</li>\n<li>Um <code>JOIN</code> com chave duplicada multiplica as linhas. Confira a contagem antes e depois.</li>\n<li>Funções de data e de texto variam entre bancos (<code>strftime</code> no SQLite, <code>DATE_TRUNC</code> no PostgreSQL, <code>FORMAT</code> no SQL Server).</li>\n</ul></div></aside>\n",
